{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out for focused therapeutic support in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Private, grounded, clinician-led care.">
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#0f1724;--muted:#94a3b8;--accent:#f0a500;--card:#0b1220;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);--glass-2:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);--radius:14px}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;color:#e6eef8;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#071026 0%, #071a2a 60%);} 
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:22px 28px;backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
    .logo{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#112036,#0c2131);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(15,23,36,.6)}
    .logo svg{width:36px;height:36px}
    nav{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:600}
    nav a.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(240,165,0,0.14), rgba(240,165,0,0.05));color:#ffdca0}
    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:32px auto;padding:24px}

    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start}
    .panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:22px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    h1{margin:0;font-size:28px;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
    p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px;line-height:1.45}

    /* contact column */
    .card-cta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}
    .info-row{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .big{font-weight:700;color:#fff}
    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#ffcf7a);color:#081023;font-weight:700;border:none;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none}

    form{display:grid;gap:12px}
    input,textarea,select{background:var(--glass);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;color:#eaf2ff}
    textarea{min-height:120px}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* proof gallery */
    .proof{margin-top:22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 200px;gap:18px}
    .quote{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:18px;border-radius:12px;color:var(--muted)}
    .quote .text{color:#f8fbff;font-weight:600;font-size:15px}
    .meta{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px}
    .avatar{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#122033,#0a2030);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#cfe8ff;font-weight:700}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
    .badge{position:relative;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--glass-2);font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);cursor:default}
    .badge:hover .tip{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
    .tip{position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,6px);bottom:calc(100% + 8px);background:#071124;color:#dbefff;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:all .22s}

    /* pricing comparator */
    .comparator{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .toggle{display:flex;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);border-radius:999px;padding:6px;width:220px;gap:6px}
    .toggle button{flex:1;border-radius:999px;padding:8px 10px;background:transparent;border:none;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .toggle button.active{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#ffcf7a);color:#081023}
    .price-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
    .price{font-size:26px;color:#fff;font-weight:800}
    .muted-small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* footer notes */
    .notes{margin-top:18px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.45}

    /* responsive */
    @media (max-width:980px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.proof{grid-template-columns:1fr}.wrap{padding:18px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="48" height="48" rx="10" fill="url(#g)"/><path d="M12 28c4-8 8-12 20-12" stroke="#fff" stroke-opacity="0.9" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div style="color:#fff;font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px">A focused clinical space in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">Story</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Specialties</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Invest</a>
      <a href="faq.html">Help</a>
      <a href="book.html" class="active">Begin</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="panel">
        <h1>Reach out — the next clear step</h1>
        <p class="lead">I offer focused clinical sessions that help you notice what matters and take compassionate action. If you’re wondering whether this is a fit, send a short note about what you’re hoping to work on and I’ll respond with practical next steps.
        </p>

        <div style="margin-top:16px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
          <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">or call <span style="color:#fff;font-weight:700">{{PHONE}}</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="proof">
          <div>
            <div class="quote panel" aria-live="polite">
              <div class="text" id="testimonialText">"The work felt clear and doable after our session."</div>
              <div class="meta">
                <div class="avatar" id="testimonialAuthor">A</div>
                <div>
                  <div style="font-weight:700;color:#fff" id="testimonialFrom">- Client</div>
                  <div class="muted">Private, confidential reflections</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:10px">
              <div class="badges">
                <div class="badge" tabindex="0">Licensed
                  <div class="tip" role="tooltip">Licensed clinician in {{STATE}}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="badge" tabindex="0">Clinical Training
                  <div class="tip" role="tooltip">Clinical certification and ongoing training</div>
                </div>
                <div class="badge" tabindex="0">Telehealth
                  <div class="tip" role="tooltip">Secure remote sessions available</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px">
            <div class="panel small muted" style="padding:12px;border-radius:12px">
              <div style="font-weight:700;color:#fff">Quick contact</div>
              <div class="muted" style="margin-top:6px">Prefer email? I respond to messages within 48 business hours.</div>
              <div style="margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:#fff;text-decoration:none">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
              <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:#fff;text-decoration:none">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
            </div>

            <div class="panel comparator" aria-hidden="false">
              <div class="small muted">Explore typical investments</div>
              <div class="toggle" role="tablist" aria-label="Pricing toggle">
                <button id="opt1" class="active" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Per Session</button>
                <button id="opt2" role="tab" aria-selected="false">3-Session Series</button>
              </div>
              <div class="price-row">
                <div>
                  <div class="price" id="priceNumber">$160</div>
                  <div class="muted-small">in-person / telehealth</div>
                </div>
                <div style="margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Sliding scale available</div>
              </div>
              <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px">Packages include collaborative planning, short check-ins, and a focused wrap-up.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="notes">
          <div style="font-weight:700;color:#fff">Confidentiality & scope</div>
          <div style="margin-top:8px">Clinical sessions are confidential within the limits set by law (for example: risk of harm, abuse, or court orders). I do not provide emergency services. If you or someone else is in imminent danger, call local emergency services or dial <strong>988</strong> for the Suicide & Crisis Lifeline in the U.S.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="panel card-cta">
        <div style="font-weight:800;color:#fff">Send a brief note</div>
        <form id="contactForm" onsubmit="return false;">
          <input name="name" placeholder="Your name" required>
          <input name="email" placeholder="Your email" required>
          <input name="phone" placeholder="Phone (optional)">
          <select name="reason">
            <option value="">Reason for contact</option>
            <option>Explore short planning sessions</option>
            <option>Therapy series/support</option>
            <option>Questions about logistics</option>
          </select>
          <textarea name="message" placeholder="A short note about what you’re hoping to address"></textarea>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
            <button class="btn" id="sendBtn">Send message</button>
            <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Or book: <a href="book.html" style="color:#fff">Start a session</a></div>
          </div>
        </form>

        <div style="margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">I aim to respond within 48 business hours. If you haven’t heard back within that time frame, please call or email directly.</div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),rgba(255,255,255,0.02));font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">
          <strong style="color:#fff">Practice boundaries</strong>
          <div style="margin-top:8px">I provide outpatient psychotherapy for adolescents and adults. I do not diagnose for legal proceedings, provide forensic evaluations, or offer on-call crisis intervention. If you need immediate help, please contact emergency services.</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    // Testimonials / Proof Gallery
    (function(){
      const testimonials = [
        {text: "I left each meeting with next steps that actually fit my life.", author: "A.H."},
        {text: "Warm, practical guidance. I felt understood and guided.", author: "S."},
        {text: "A calm place to sort through one stubborn problem.", author: "M."}
      ];
      let i = 0;
      const txt = document.getElementById('testimonialText');
      const auth = document.getElementById('testimonialAuthor');
      const from = document.getElementById('testimonialFrom');
      function show(idx){
        const t = testimonials[idx];
        txt.textContent = '"'+t.text+'"';
        auth.textContent = t.author[0] || 'C';
        from.textContent = '- ' + t.author;
      }
      show(0);
      setInterval(()=>{ i = (i+1) % testimonials.length; show(i); }, 5000);
    })();

    // Pricing comparator with animated numbers
    (function(){
      const priceEl = document.getElementById('priceNumber');
      const opt1 = document.getElementById('opt1');
      const opt2 = document.getElementById('opt2');
      const prices = {one:160, series:420}; // example framing
      let current = prices.one;
      function animateTo(target){
        const start = current;
        const dur = 450;
        const startTs = performance.now();
        function step(ts){
          const t = Math.min(1,(ts-startTs)/dur);
          const val = Math.round(start + (target-start) * (1 - Math.pow(1-t,3)));
          priceEl.textContent = '$' + val;
          if(t < 1){ requestAnimationFrame(step); } else { current = target; }
        }
        requestAnimationFrame(step);
      }
      opt1.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        opt1.classList.add('active'); opt2.classList.remove('active');
        opt1.setAttribute('aria-selected','true'); opt2.setAttribute('aria-selected','false');
        animateTo(prices.one);
      });
      opt2.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        opt2.classList.add('active'); opt1.classList.remove('active');
        opt2.setAttribute('aria-selected','true'); opt1.setAttribute('aria-selected','false');
        animateTo(prices.series);
      });
    })();

    // Simple form faux-submission (no backend)
    document.getElementById('sendBtn').addEventListener('click', function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      this.textContent = 'Sending...';
      setTimeout(()=>{ this.textContent = 'Message sent'; setTimeout(()=>{ this.textContent = 'Send message'; }, 2200); }, 900);
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and local notes for the private_practice_therapist site (chunk 4)

Files included in this chunk:
- contact.html  : Contact / connect page with proof gallery and pricing comparator micro-interactions.

Placeholders used (do not remove; replace at deploy time):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Features implemented on contact.html:
- Navigation matching site pages (Home, Story, Specialties, Method, Invest, Help, Begin, Connect).
- Hero with contact intent and a CTA button that uses PRIMARY_CTA_URL and PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL.
- A rotating "Proof Gallery" (testimonials) that cycles text and author every 5s and displays credibility badges with tooltips.
- A micro "Pricing Comparator" toggle between Per Session and 3-Session Series with animated number transitions.
- Contact form (client-side only) with a simulated send interaction (no backend). 
- Confidentiality, scope boundaries, and crisis guidance language included.

Accessibility & safety notes:
- Tooltips are exposed on hover and focus; aria roles added to basic elements.
- Crisis instructions explicitly advise emergency services and 988 for U.S. users.
- No medical claims or guarantees are made; language is clinical and supportive.

Local testing:
1) Serve the project folder with a static server (e.g., `npx serve` or `python -m http.server`).
2) Open http://localhost:5000/contact.html (or the port your server uses).
3) Replace placeholders when integrating into the full site.

Design notes:
- Visual identity leans toward a calm, modern palette and a compact, playful UI (rounded cards, warm accent).
- The contact page intentionally balances clear action (CTA / phone / email) with clinical boundaries.

Developer notes:
- This chunk does not include assets/img/pattern.svg — that asset is created in a different chunk.
- Pricing values in the comparator are example figures inlined in JS (prices.one, prices.series) and can be adjusted from the script.
- The form is intentionally client-side only. Integrate with your preferred backend or form endpoint as needed.

If you need a variation of the contact copy or different interactive behavior (e.g., longer testimonial list, remote badge set, or currency localization), tell me which pieces to change and I will update the HTML/JS accordingly."}
BUNDLE_END
